{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_036310","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"听说<R=CIA,LA CIA>那帮人的核武器叫“Peace Walker”？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=CIA,LA CIA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":65,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"是啊，怎么了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"这是在故意挖苦<R=尼加拉瓜人,NICA>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=尼加拉瓜人,NICA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"你说的是William Walker？你以前提过。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":47,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"对，不过那已经是一百多年前的事了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"当时尼加拉瓜政党斗争很激烈。自由党为了对抗保守党，找来了美国雇佣兵。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"那个人就是William Walker。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":32,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"可Walker打败保守党后，顺势夺取了尼加拉瓜的政权，最后甚至当上了总统。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"对自由党来说，本想借他一臂之力，结果反倒引狼入室了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"还不止如此。他不但把英语定为官方语言，甚至还实行了奴隶制。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"Walker的目标，是建立一个以美国南部为中心的“环加勒比海帝国”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"“环加勒比海帝国”……原来如此，或许和Coldman的目标很接近。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":85,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"美国一向如此。总是打着对自己有利的旗号，在别人的国家里横行霸道。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"还叫什么<R=和平行走计划,PEACE WALKER>啊。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=和平行走计划,PEACE WALKER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":53,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"最后Walker怎么样了？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"后来，以哥斯达黎加为中心的中美洲联军集结起来，打败了他，把他赶回了美国。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"那我们就照样来一次吧。我们也不会让Coldman为所欲为。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":73,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"是啊……靠你了，Boss。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":31,"review_flag":""}]}